msgstr "Bezplatná sada nástrojů pro správu pro Simple File List"

#: includes/ee-admin-tools.php:49
msgid ""
"The Simple File List Tools plugin provides professional debugging tools, "
"custom tweaks system, and administrative utilities to enhance your "
"development experience."
msgstr ""
"Plugin Simple File List Tools nabízí profesionální nástroje pro ladění, "
"systém vlastních úprav a správcovské nástroje, které vám usnadní práci při "
"vývoji."

#: includes/ee-admin-tools.php:51
msgid "Key Features:"
msgstr "Hlavní vlastnosti:"

#: includes/ee-admin-tools.php:61
msgid "Completely free for all Simple File List admins."
msgstr "Zcela zdarma pro všechny správce služby Simple File List."

#: includes/ee-admin-tools.php:65
msgid "Download Free Tools Plugin"
msgstr "Stáhnout plugin Free Tools"

#: includes/ee-admin-tools.php:78
msgid "Installation"
msgstr "Instalace"

#: includes/ee-admin-tools.php:82
msgid "Easy setup in just a few steps"
msgstr "Snadné nastavení v několika krocích"

#: includes/ee-admin-tools.php:92
msgid ""
"The plugin integrates seamlessly using WordPress hooks - no modifications to "
